<headline>NHL ICE HOCKEY-SUNDAY'S SECOND ROUND STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of second round</p>
<p>National Hockey League Stanley Cup playoff games on Sunday</p>
<p>(home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>Eastern Conference semifinals</p>
<p> NY Rangers	 2     NEW JERSEY	0</p>
<p>(Best-of-seven series tied 1-1)</p>
<p> DETROIT	    3     Ahaheim	   2 (3-OT)</p>
<p>(Detroit leads best-of-seven series 2-0)</p>
<p>Western Conference semifinals</p>
<p>Edmonton at COLORADO</p>
<p>(Colorado leads best-of-seven series 1-0)</p>
</text>
